      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Thank you for the request! We released VRChat avatar marketplace earlier this year.\n\nhttps://hello.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace\n\nIf you'd like to post additional feature request, feedback, or bug reports about the avatar marketplace, please post them on the following board: https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-marketplace",
